{#
  High-contrast serif, near-monochrome, symmetrical — the one direction where
  centring is right.

  The signature is the mat: a hairline frame fixed just inside the four edges
  of the viewport, so the page reads as something mounted and framed rather
  than something scrolled. It is borrowed from gallery mounts and engraved
  invitations, which is exactly the world this direction is selling to.

  It is fixed rather than drawn around the content, so it holds its position
  down the whole page. pointer-events are off so it can never intercept a tap
  on the phone number underneath it.
#}
{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% block style %}
body{background:#f4f2ee;color:#26262a;font-family:Optima,Candara,'Gill Sans',sans-serif}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:.75rem;z-index:5;
  border:1px solid rgba(38,38,42,.28);pointer-events:none}
@media(min-width:820px){body::before{inset:1.5rem}}
{# The frame must not sit on top of the words. #}
.wrap{padding:0 2.5rem}
.hero{padding:5rem 2.5rem 3rem;text-align:center}
footer,.closing{padding-left:2.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem}
h1{font-family:Didot,'Bodoni MT','Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;
  font-size:clamp(2.4rem,8vw,4.8rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.02em;
  word-spacing:.5em;margin:0;line-height:1.1}
.lede{margin:1.6rem auto 0;max-width:30rem;font-size:.98rem;opacity:.75}
.hero-img{margin:2.5rem auto 0;max-width:min(48rem,100%);filter:saturate(.6)}
.band{text-align:center}
h2{font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.28em;font-weight:400;
  margin:0 auto 1.6rem;padding:.7rem 0;max-width:60%;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
h3{font-family:Didot,Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:400;
  letter-spacing:.06em;margin:2rem 0 .7rem}
.item{max-width:30rem;margin:0 auto;text-align:left;font-size:.95rem}
.item .dots{border-bottom-style:solid;opacity:.2}
.gallery img{filter:saturate(.6)}
.facts-grid{display:grid;gap:2.5rem}
@media(min-width:700px){.facts-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
{% endblock %}
